<|im_start|>user
Problem: Given the point \( P(x, y) \) on the ellipse \(\frac{x^{2}}{4}+\frac{y^{2}}{9}=1\), find the maximum value of \( 2x - y \).

Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{}.<|im_end|>
